"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]你的命运？你就是因为大兽潮才从原本的护林人转职成布宴者吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":80,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-204,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara004_1","addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1c","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3","img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1f"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":510,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-272,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara025_1","addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1f","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]也不完全是因为“灾变之宴”啦，我只是有些厌倦护林人的工作罢了。每天面对一望无际的树林，还有无穷无尽的猎物，我不喜欢这样的生活。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3","img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1g"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]我希望能接触更多各种各样的人，用美食、乐章和宴会为森林里的大家带来幸福。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]所以在艾尔莎离开的一年后，我就加入了布宴者。然后就一直在布拉格乌尔大师手下学习，他当时算是比较开明的元老会成员了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":80,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-204,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara004_1","addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":510,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-272,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara025_1","addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1g","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾尔莎","text":"[show]仅仅几年时间就从普通的布宴者爬到了首领的位置，你还真是深藏不露呢，我以前可没看出你有这么大的本事。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":80,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-204,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara004_1","addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3","img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":510,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-272,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara025_1","addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]嘿嘿……算不上什么本事啦，可能是我的性格适合这个职位吧。布拉格乌尔大师说过，真诚是最好的武器，我只是用心真诚地对待每一个人罢了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":80,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-204,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara004_1","addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":50,"bright":1,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"x":50,"bright":1,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"x":510,"bright":0.6,"transTime":300,"y":-272,"scaleX":1,"noIn":false,"mirrow":true,"img":"chara025_1","addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"ti